# Access logs generated by the default TRAEFIK_LOG_DIR. They hold client IPs and
# full request URLs — personal data, and sometimes tokens in query strings — so
# they must never reach a public repository. Same rule as the model catalogs:
# the repo ships the mechanism, the data stays outside.
logs/
